      "migration": "assertion:literalValue range widened xsd:string -> rdfs:Literal so a typed (xsd:decimal) or language-tagged literal object can be mapped without losing its datatype. Existing data is unchanged; the SHACL shape now requires a literal rather than a string, and object representation is hasObject XOR literalValue.",
